# tcps-evidence pack ontology stub.
# The ver:Check facts are EMITTED by scripts/verify.sh into evidence/ontology.ttl
# (volatile per-run content: timestamps, exit codes, graph-hash binding) and are
# loaded as a PROJECT ontology import, not pack content -- pack bytes must stay
# stable so ggen.lock pinning (FM-PACK-008) never races the evidence emitter.
@prefix ver: <http://seanchatmangpt.github.io/packs/ggen-verify#> .
